      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">هُوَ مَرُونٌ بِهِ</span></b>  <i>He is overcome, subdued,</i> or <i>subjected.</i> (K.) [<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَرُونٌ</span> here is a contraction of
